  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your outdoor experience with Rothco's Ranger Vest. Crafted from a durable Cotton/Polyester blend, this versatile vest is designed for tactical utility. It boasts 8 front pockets secured with hook &amp; loop and zippers, offering ample storage for essentials. The rear features a convenient hook &amp; loop game bag and shell loops for added functionality. The zippered collar with a hood enhances adaptability to various conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "11433",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your outdoor experience with Rothco's Ranger Vest. Crafted from a durable Cotton/Polyester blend, this versatile vest is designed for tactical utility. It boasts 8 front pockets secured with hook &amp; loop and zippers, offering ample storage for essentials. The rear features a convenient hook &amp; loop game bag and shell loops for added functionality. The zippered collar with a hood enhances adaptability to various conditions. Available in 6 colors, including Woodland Camouflage and Black, this Ranger Vest is your go-to for style and practicality in outdoor adventures. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and military personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
